#ASSERT (`s 4A(1)(a)(i)(A) the individual's net personal assets exceed the amount` WITH `the person is an individual` IS TRUE, `the value of the individual's net personal assets other than the primary residence` IS 2500000, `the estimated fair market value of the primary residence` IS 0, `the outstanding amounts in respect of credit facilities secured by the residence` IS 0, `the Authority has prescribed another amount in place of the first amount` IS TRUE, `the other amount the Authority has prescribed, in Singapore dollars` IS 3000000) EQUALS JUST FALSE
