-- a financial asset: limb (the asset is a deposit as defined in section 4B of the Banking Act 1970)
#ASSERT `s 4A(1)(a)(i)(B) the asset is a financial asset` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- a financial asset: limb (the asset is an investment product as defined in section 2(1) of the Financial Advisers Act 2001)
#ASSERT `s 4A(1)(a)(i)(B) the asset is a financial asset` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
