-- (B): the balance sheet is dated more than 12 months before the date asked (14 June 2025 against 15 June 2026)
#ASSERT (`s 4A(1)(a)(ii) the corporation's net assets exceed the amount` WITH `the person is a corporation` IS TRUE, `the corporation has a most recent audited balance sheet` IS FALSE, `the net assets shown by the most recent audited balance sheet` IS 0, `the corporation is required to prepare audited accounts regularly` IS FALSE, `the corporation has certified a balance sheet as giving a true and fair view of its state of affairs as of the date of the balance sheet` IS TRUE, `the net assets shown by the certified balance sheet` IS 12000000, `the date of the certified balance sheet` IS (Date 14 6 2025), `the date asked` IS (Date 15 6 2026), `the Authority has prescribed another amount in place of the first amount` IS FALSE, `the other amount the Authority has prescribed, in Singapore dollars` IS 0) EQUALS JUST FALSE
